    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1820">

                <pb facs="1189" n="1073" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg1073"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 871.001/6.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">President Wilson to King Ferdinand.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">The White House</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-10-12">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 12, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>On this sad occasion of the death of your illustrious uncle, I wish to express
                    the earnest hope that Your Majesty’s reign will mark an era of great prosperity.
                    I also offer to Your Majesty the assurances of my highest regards and good
                    wishes.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Woodrow Wilson</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
